      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hello! Doing some information gathering here. \n\nWhen you go to edit your bindings, is your Current Binding \"VRChat Default Bindings for [controller type]?\" or a Personal binding? \n\nAdditionally, does the \"Current Controller\" section show the controller that  you are using? \n\nSteamVR Settings > Controllers > Manage Controller Bindings > Edit This Binding\n\nor\n\nIn-game: Main Menu > Controls > Edit SteamVR Bindings\n\nIf the current controller setting is mismatched, try selecting the correct one from the drop-down and see if that helps. \n\nIf you have a custom binding, it is also possible that the \"interact\" control was unmapped from the trigger, which can also lead to the buttons not being selectable while in the loading screen.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
