  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Ever since I went into the Beta to test out the new hand tracking I haven't been able to formally go past the default screen of VR chat. I pressed the \"GO\" button it doesn't do anything I pressed the \"go to default home\" and it doesn't do anything. My account seems okay I just don't know what's going on. I left the beta and went back to regular normal gameplay of VR chat and I'm still having this issue.\n\nUpdate: Going into desktop mode and turning on bypass the Go option in the main menu fixes it, but I never had to do this since I kinda want the option to go into the default home world. VRChat please fix this",
